            <title>[MAHOUT-508] ARFF Driver configuration for mahout script missing</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-508</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I noticed that org.apache.mahout.utils.vectors.arff.Driver was missing from the list of classes in driver.classes.props and that there was no props file so I added a patch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can now run the driver via mahout arff.vector&lt;/p&gt;</description>
